      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "きみの踊りは大評判、新しい飲み物も大好評！\nおかげでお客が増える一方だ。有り難いよ。\n次は中層の名士たちに声をかけるつもりだ。\n新しい商品の材料と舞を頼みたい。よろしくな。",
        "official_en": "With the expanded menu and you drawing in so\nmany guests, I've got loads of new customers. Now I\nwant to invite some notable middle-class people.\nWould you give me the ingredients, and a dance?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
